{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお洋服はこちら(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/09/29/5001380/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じつは実はこの白いレースワンピースは\n去年のぐるぐるカーテンの個別握手in名古屋で着てたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから敢えて名古屋ということで着てみました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは大人になったかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真は髪型変える前に撮ったんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一部はゆるふわ巻き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二部はツインテール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三部はハーフアップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/09/29/5001380/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタート前に！\nみさみさと私、\n二期のまいちゅん、みりあちゃん、きいちゃん、\n鏡越しでパシャリ＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/09/29/5001380/0001.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさにぎゅっとされて照れな若月。笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/09/29/5001380/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も\n最高な握手でしたよ(>_<)♪＼♪\n笑顔が溢れるレーンになったね(>_<)！\n本当に\n皆さんありがとう♪(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日\n支えられてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴりおやすみなさい！またね！"}],"source":"archive"}